#!/usr/bin/env python3
# setup_home2_v2: new top of the home page (xpertcreation.com), from Macaroni's plan.
#  v2: tiles XpertConnect / XpertAcademy / XpertFreelance / Marketplace (Jobs and Money & Bills move into the groups),
#      and the 5 steps: 1 create one account (once, for everything), 2 learn, 3 freelance and earn, 4 socialize, 5 sell.
#      New XpertAcademy logo in /brand/xpertacademy/ (mark-128/256/512 + svg).
#      Works on a fresh home page and on one that already has v1.
#  - Signed out: "One app. Everything you need." + Create account / Browse tools + Founder chip + Google reviews chip.
#  - Everyone: "Start here" with a search box that opens any feature, 4 big tiles (XpertConnect, XpertAcademy,
#    Jobs, Money & Bills) and "Explore more" in 7 groups (Work & Career, Learn, Social, Money, Marketplace,
#    Daily Life, Tools). The old "All apps" grid of 14 tiles is removed. The new top sits right under the menu bar;
#    the featured strip, the big cards and the banner slider move below it.
#  - English, Urdu and Arabic text. Tools count read live from the Tools page. Fixes the Bengali tools count.
#  - Google rating is shown only if you give it:  --rating 4.9 --reviews 23  (never made up).
#   python3 /root/setup_home2_v2.py                 dry run
#   python3 /root/setup_home2_v2.py --apply         install (backup in /root/home2_bak_<time>)
